# Assistant content: a bullet list. internal/tui/markdown.go's Item style
# gives every bullet a "• " prefix (buildStyle's listBullet mapping).
@faux testdata/faux/qa/content-bullets.yaml
@size 120x40

WAITFOR /describe a task/ 20
SHOT welcome
TYPE explain the change
KEY enter
WAITFOR /redis mock/ 20
SHOT reply
EXPECT /• Added the rate limiter middleware/
EXPECT /• Wired it into the upload route/
EXPECT /• Added a redis mock for tests/
# A wrapped item continues under its text, two columns in from the bullet.
EXPECT /• Kept the old fixed-window counter[^\n]*\n    [a-z]/
EXPECT_NOT /panic|goroutine/
